flowchart LR
  R[Report or Classifier Signal] --> T[Triage]
  T --> E[Evidence Snapshot]
  E --> C[Moderation Case]
  C --> H{Human Review Required?}
  H -->|yes| HR[Reviewer Decision]
  H -->|low-risk limited automation| AR[Limited Automated Action]
  HR --> A[Action + Reason Code]
  AR --> A
  A --> N[Reasoned User Notice]
  N --> AP{Appealable?}
  AP -->|yes| P[Appeal]
  P --> REV[Review]
  REV --> CLOSE[Close / Uphold / Overturn]
  AP -->|no| CLOSE
